      "writtenOn": "2020-01-21T23:24:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I intentionally didn\u0027t specify it as a callback because as I understand it, it\u0027s difficult for game engines to deal with callback threads and integrating with the system smoothly. By making it a polling model like this, they don\u0027t have to worry about figuring out where to plug this into their game loop, deal with locking, etc.",
